<!--
  Privacy Policy 模板 — ae-legal-generate
  产出自 speckit + ~/.ae/legal/company.json

  ⚠️ 重要：首次使用前应由公司法务/律师审阅本模板，确认符合业务所在司法管辖区要求。
  当前模板参考 Apple Guideline 5.1.1 基础要求，非律师起草。
-->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Privacy Policy — {{product.name}}</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; max-width: 760px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px; line-height: 1.6; color: #222; }
    h1 { border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 10px; }
    h2 { margin-top: 36px; color: #333; }
    .last-updated { color: #888; font-size: 14px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="last-updated">Last Updated: {{last_updated}}</p>

<p>{{company.subject_en}} ("we", "us", or "our") operates the <strong>{{product.name}}</strong> mobile application (the "Service"). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and disclose information when you use our Service.</p>

<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

<p>We collect the following categories of information:</p>

<ul>
  {{#data_sharing.fields}}
  <li><strong>{{name}}</strong> — {{purpose}}</li>
  {{/data_sharing.fields}}
</ul>

<h2>2. Third-Party Services</h2>

<p>The Service uses the following third-party services that may collect information:</p>

<ul>
  {{#data_sharing.third_parties}}
  <li><strong>{{name}}</strong> — {{purpose}} (<a href="{{privacy_url}}">{{name}} Privacy Policy</a>)</li>
  {{/data_sharing.third_parties}}
</ul>

<h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>

<ul>
  <li>To provide, operate, and maintain the Service</li>
  <li>To improve, personalize, and expand the Service</li>
  <li>To understand and analyze how you use the Service</li>
  <li>To communicate with you, including for customer service</li>
  <li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Data Retention</h2>

<p>We retain your data only for as long as necessary for the purposes set out in this Privacy Policy, unless a longer retention period is required by law.</p>

<h2>5. Your Rights</h2>

<p>Depending on your jurisdiction ({{company.jurisdiction}}), you may have the following rights regarding your personal data:</p>

<ul>
  <li>The right to access, update, or delete your information</li>
  <li>The right to rectification of inaccurate data</li>
  <li>The right to object to processing</li>
  <li>The right to data portability</li>
</ul>

<p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:{{company.email}}">{{company.email}}</a>.</p>

<h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>

<p>Our Service does not address anyone under the minimum age required by applicable law in your jurisdiction:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>China (PIPL):</strong> under {{child_min_age.china_pipl}}</li>
  <li><strong>European Union (GDPR):</strong> under {{child_min_age.eu_gdpr}}</li>
  <li><strong>United States (COPPA):</strong> under {{child_min_age.us_coppa}}</li>
  <li><strong>Other jurisdictions:</strong> under {{child_min_age.default}}</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from children below these thresholds.</p>

{{#llm_vendors}}
<h2>6b. Third-Party AI / LLM Processors</h2>

<p>We use the following third-party AI/LLM service providers to process your inputs and generate responses:</p>
<ul>
{{#llm_vendors}}
  <li><strong>{{name}}</strong> — data region: {{data_region}}{{#cross_border}}. <em>Your data may be transferred cross-border to the {{data_region}} region for processing. Under China PIPL, this constitutes a cross-border data transfer; by using this Service you consent to such transfer, provided that we ensure appropriate safeguards (standard contractual clauses, security assessments, or equivalent).</em>{{/cross_border}}{{^cross_border}}. Data is processed within {{data_region}} only; no cross-border transfer occurs.{{/cross_border}}</li>
{{/llm_vendors}}
</ul>

<p>For users in China, in accordance with the Personal Information Protection Law (PIPL), you have the right to know the identity, processing purpose, categories of personal information, and retention period of each above processor, and to withdraw your consent at any time via {{consent_withdrawal_path}}.</p>
{{/llm_vendors}}

{{#sensitive_info_categories}}
<h2>6c. Sensitive Personal Information</h2>

<p>Our Service may process the following categories of sensitive personal information, which require your <strong>separate consent</strong> beyond general Privacy Policy acceptance:</p>
<ul>
{{#sensitive_info_categories}}
  <li>{{.}}</li>
{{/sensitive_info_categories}}
</ul>
<p>You will be prompted for separate consent at the first point of collection for each category. You may withdraw consent at any time via {{consent_withdrawal_path}}.</p>
{{/sensitive_info_categories}}

<h2>7. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

<p>We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last Updated" date.</p>

<h2>8. Contact</h2>

<p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Email: <a href="mailto:{{company.email}}">{{company.email}}</a></li>
  <li>Company: {{company.subject_en}}</li>
  {{#company.website}}<li>Website: <a href="{{.}}">{{.}}</a></li>{{/company.website}}
</ul>

</body>
</html>
